/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 57 0 R
/T (Student records frequently contain assessment marks and estimates of time spent studying. When these records are stored in a spreadsheet, comparing distributions, courses and unusual observations can be time-consuming. A small analytical dashboard can standardise data validation and present useful summaries for exploration. )
/E (Student records frequently contain assessment marks and estimates of time spent studying. When these records are stored in a spreadsheet, comparing distributions, courses and unusual observations can be time-consuming. A small analytical dashboard can standardise data validation and present useful summaries for exploration. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
