<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 57 0 R
/T (The developed application is a Python desktop interface. It displays key performance indicators, a study-hours-versus-score scatter plot, score and grade distributions, course comparisons, an outlier table, and a written statistical interpretation. Users can work with the preloaded synthetic dataset or import an anonymised CSV file. )
/E (The developed application is a Python desktop interface. It displays key performance indicators, a study-hours-versus-score scatter plot, score and grade distributions, course comparisons, an outlier table, and a written statistical interpretation. Users can work with the preloaded synthetic dataset or import an anonymised CSV file. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
