/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 57 0 R
/T (Problem statement: Investigate assessment scores and reported study hours using anonymised records. Build score/grade functions, handle records in dictionaries and CSV, implement a StudentRecord class, compute array statistics with NumPy, aggregate by course with Pandas, and draw scatter plots and histograms. Evaluate whether the apparent relationship persists after handling outliers, without interpreting correlation as causation. )
/E (Problem statement: Investigate assessment scores and reported study hours using anonymised records. Build score/grade functions, handle records in dictionaries and CSV, implement a StudentRecord class, compute array statistics with NumPy, aggregate by course with Pandas, and draw scatter plots and histograms. Evaluate whether the apparent relationship persists after handling outliers, without interpreting correlation as causation. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
