/T (Limitations: \(i\) the included observations are synthetic, \(ii\) study hours are self-reported, \(iii\) the dashboard is descriptive rather than predictive, \(iv\) the statistical thresholds are exploratory, and \(v\) valid student identifiers are anonymised but the application has no user accounts or access controls. Additionally, grades use a fixed threshold scheme that may not match every institution. )
/E (Limitations: \(i\) the included observations are synthetic, \(ii\) study hours are self-reported, \(iii\) the dashboard is descriptive rather than predictive, \(iv\) the statistical thresholds are exploratory, and \(v\) valid student identifiers are anonymised but the application has no user accounts or access controls. Additionally, grades use a fixed threshold scheme that may not match every institution. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
