/E (Possible extensions include an Add/Edit/Delete Student form, an integrated local database, assignment-specific grade thresholds, time-series tracking across semesters, downloadable summaries, handling of missing values under configurable policies, and richer analysis of possible confounding variables. Any real student dataset should be collected with appropriate consent and managed with privacy safeguards. )
