259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 61 0 R
/T (The project demonstrates a complete workflow for inspecting student study hours and assessment scores: CSV handling, record validation, object-oriented design, NumPy statistics, Pandas course aggregation, Matplotlib charts and a Tkinter dashboard. On the included synthetic data, a positive association persists after excluding IQR-flagged outliers, but the strength of the Pearson correlation changes substantially. The central analytical conclusion is therefore cautious: the dashboard can reveal and communicate patterns, but it cannot determine that study hours cause assessment results. )
/E (The project demonstrates a complete workflow for inspecting student study hours and assessment scores: CSV handling, record validation, object-oriented design, NumPy statistics, Pandas course aggregation, Matplotlib charts and a Tkinter dashboard. On the included synthetic data, a positive association persists after excluding IQR-flagged outliers, but the strength of the Pearson correlation changes substantially. The central analytical conclusion is therefore cautious: the dashboard can reveal and communicate patterns, but it cannot determine that study hours cause assessment results. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
