/Title (This project develops a Python-based desktop dashboard to examine whether reported weekly study hours are associated with student assessment scores. It uses anonymised student identifiers, validates scores and study hours, converts scores to letter grades, supports CSV import and export, summarises performance by course, and displays statistical charts. The implementation combines object-oriented programming and standard CSV handling with NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib and Tkinter.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 463 0 R
